# DIRECTIVE ZERO — AM-03 junction7-internal sshd_config
# SSH on non-standard port 34483 (matching the source WinterMute box).
# Key-only auth — players get a shell by injecting their SSH key via the
# Struts RCE, then SSH in for a proper TTY.

Port 34483
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes

ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server